// `Instruction.Act` under Lean's own name for it: the handoff, "<performer>
// <body>", to a player or a permanent ("target creature explores"
// [CR#701.44a]). Inside the body `actor` is that performer; a distributive
// performer ("each opponent") has each member perform the whole body (ADR 7,
// rulings 2026-10-05; the alias, ADR 12.1).
(
    name: "act",
    kinds: [Instruction],
    params: {"performer": NounPhrase, "body": Instruction},
    body: Act(performer: Param(performer), body: Param(body)),
)
